    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91abbae9aeca12e3879022f1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "莱茵力量真厉害呀！\n能长时间保持好脚力，\n最后的末脚也爆发力惊人！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bc831e5f85e54c0af6f274a1614d33f35b502e4929eac77156f5551f7b38263",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
