    {
      "uid": "zhcn:003c5859701957f0a1ec4034",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "勇敢之心目送着对手的背影。\n然而那视线与其说是不甘，\n更像是一种纯粹的憧憬。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e0946928fd7e6da7be00fdadea277078369e565a7c4832fdf626d363114dba8",
