    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7af3881405ba57fb48f13550",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员。\n――要不要换个跑法？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3115e29c23ebdb5bafe5d288b3e9f6e9cddd47828ef2ec40e3b01b5b042f481a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        41,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/41/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7bba306f0588dfa3df4dc1e4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "改变跑法……有多种解释。\n但在这个场合，恐怕是指改变脚质的意思吧。\n因为――\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "019e0eadbc955400478500c1e6c3ebd74c9649af05d2bc9f16b1a34261ac8ff2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112114.json",
      "json_path": [
