      "uid": "zhcn:1a9c503783d2b71e46e481ad",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即使坚持现在的跑法，也追不上力量……\n既然如此，就应该彻底改变些什么吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "df56deb1fda5bf63aad972143489fbd337e8f3c38cf1596f646d61da2c58a790",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
